gantt
  dateFormat x
  axisFormat %Q
  tickInterval 2millisecond
  todayMarker off
  section Analysis
    T1 TASK written :done, t1, 0, 2ms
    T2 Task review :active, t2, 2, 1ms
  section Build
    T3 Stubs :t3, 3, 2ms
    T4 Lint script and its probe pairs for every rule :crit, t4, 5, 3ms
    T5 Render check :t5, 5, 4ms
  section Release
    T6 Changelog :t6, 9, 1ms
